# A case arm binds 'm' in [case [let m] pattern body] but 'm' is never
# referenced in the body. The MatchArm lost-binding path emits a warning.
[call [fn [let]
  [Color: [type Red Green Blue]]
  [match Color.Red
    [case [let m] [Color.Red m] 1]
    ...: 0]]]
=== out
Int(1)

=== warn
variable 'm' is never referenced
